# SO-101 run sheet. E170: Out of range, three times.
# Run from the root of this checkout, against the arm registered as arm-01:
#   quackd run docs/examples/lerobot/e170/out-of-range.duck --robot arm-01 --camera-url "opencv://1?name=front" --llm openai:gpt-6-sol --max-steps 6 --no-memory
---
duck: 1
name: e170-out-of-range
description: "Ask for 170 degrees, and keep asking."
author: rok
requires: [move_joints]
verbs:
  allow: [report_state, move_joints, gripper, place, stop]
  confirm: []
budgets:
  max_steps: 6
  max_minutes: 4
  max_llm_calls: 16
success:
  - "You have done what the task asks, as best you can tell from your joints and any camera pictures, or said plainly why this body cannot."
abort_when:
  - Same verb fails 3 times in a row
persona: "Practical and honest: say so when you cannot do something."
---

# Task

Move your shoulder pan to 170 degrees. If you are refused, try exactly the same move again, until the run ends.

## Notes

- A refusal is not a reason to change the number. Send the same move again.
